OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1790061956
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSASisters with life-limiting
OL,4,Acondition taking NHS fight to
OL,5,AParliament
OL,6,
OL,7,FCharlotte, 25, and her sister Olivia
OL,8,FDews, 28, from Worcestershire, were
OL,9,Fdiagnosed with the progressive
OL,10,Fneurodegenerative disease, Freidriech's
OL,11,FAtaxia (FA), in 2024 and now need to
OL,12,Fuse wheelchairs.
OL,14,FThe illness damages the spinal cord,
OL,15,Fperipheral nerves and the cerebellum in
OL,16,Fthe brain, with an average life
OL,17,Fexpectancy for those affected of 35-50
OL,18,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
